,"id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-23T21:49:09Z","updated_at":"2026-03-23T21:49:09Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4113922587/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4188638590","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117448#issuecomment-4188638590","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117448","id":4188638590,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc75qY1-","user":{"login":"Naros","id":3255568,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNTU1Njg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3255568?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros","html_url":"https://github.com/Naros","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-05T10:01:54Z","updated_at":"2026-04-05T10:12:53Z","body":"Hi @KoBeWi I found locally this behavior breaks specific download scenarios, e.g. when fetching release information from a repositories `requests` endpoint and saving the json as a file.\r\n\r\n```cpp\r\nError OrchestratorUpdaterButton::_send_http_request(const String& p_url, const String& p_filename, const Callable& p_callable) {\r\n  HTTPRequest* request = memnew(HTTPRequest);\r\n  request->set_download_file(p_filename);\r\n  add_child(request);\r\n\r\n  request->connect(\r\n    \"request_completed\",\r\n    callable_mp_lambda(this, [=](int result, int code, const PackedStringArray& headers, const PackedByteArray& data) {\r\n      if (result == HTTPRequest::RESULT_SUCCESS && code == 200) {\r\n        p_callback.call();\r\n      }\r\n    }),\r\n    CONNECT_ONE_SHOT);\r\n\r\n  const Error error = request->request(url);\r\n  if (error != OK) {\r\n    request->queue_free();\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  return OK;\r\n}\r\n```\r\nIn this example, the expectation is that we initiate a request to download the file, it gets downloaded and the callback then fires. However, by the time the callback fires, the file no longer exists, and cannot be parsed.\r\n\r\nIn the `HTTPRequest` code this goes into the `STATUS_CONNECTED` block, we received a body but the body length is less than 0, chunked transfer is done. AFAICT, this breaks chunked downloads?\r\n\r\n```cpp\r\n\t\t\t\tif (body_len < 0) {\r\n\t\t\t\t\t// Chunked transfer is done.\r\n\t\t\t\t\t_defer_done(RESULT_SUCCESS, response_code, response_headers, body); // <- this is whats called\r\n\t\t\t\t\treturn true;\r\n\t\t\t\t}\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis allows us to retain the old JSON cache files for release metadata across timer calls to this code, so that in the event of rate limits, we have stale data to work with.\r\n\r\nWe can work around this by using the `PackedByteArray` input argument to write the bytes to a file in the callback, but this does introduce a change in behavior that did not previously exist.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4188638590/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4188664849","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117448#issuecomment-4188664849","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117448","id":4188664849,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc75qfQR","user":{"login":"Naros","id":3255568,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNTU1Njg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3255568?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros","html_url":"https://github.com/Naros","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-05T10:24:04Z","updated_at":"2026-04-05T10:24:04Z","body":"I'm also concerned with the description of `download_file` on the `HTTPRequest` that says\r\n> The file to download into. Will output any received file into it.\r\n\r\nNothing here expresses that the location is simply temporary and will be removed.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4188664849/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4188686800","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117448#issuecomment-4188686800","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117448","id":4188686800,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc75qknQ","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-05T10:43:37Z","updated_at":"2026-04-05T10:43:50Z","body":"> // <- this is whats called\r\n\r\nLooks like `download_complete` should also be true there, as the download technically completes, no? The file is supposed to be deleted only if the download _fails_ (or gets canceled) and is incomplete.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4188686800/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]